</ul>
<!-- endsource: en/_includes/work_src/reusage-python/penalties_format.md -->
<p><strong>Type</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>list</li>
<li>numpy.ndarray</li>
<li>string</li>
<li>dict</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Default value</strong></p>
<p>0 for all features</p>
<p><strong>Supported processing units</strong></p>
<p>CPU</p>
<h2 id="fixed_binary_splits"><a href="en/references/training-parameters/common#fixed_binary_splits" class="yfm-anchor yfm-clipboard-anchor" aria-hidden="true"></a>fixed_binary_splits</h2>
<p>Command-line: <code class="yfm-clipboard-inline-code" role="button" tabindex='0' id="inline-code-id-3pct31qd">--fixed-binary-splits</code></p>
<h4 id="description47"><a href="en/references/training-parameters/common#description47" class="yfm-anchor yfm-clipboard-anchor" aria-hidden="true"></a>Description</h4>
<p>A list of indices of binary features to put at the top of each tree; ignored if <code class="yfm-clipboard-inline-code" role="button" tabindex='0' id="inline-code-id-bda7pehr">grow_policy</code> is <code class="yfm-clipboard-inline-code" role="button" tabindex='0' id="inline-code-id-rs8y04dk">Symmetric</code>.</p>
<p><strong>Type</strong></p>
<p>list</p>
<p><strong>Default value</strong></p>
<p>None</p>
<p><strong>Supported processing units</strong></p>
<p>GPU</p>
<h2 id="penalties_coefficient"><a href="en/references/training-parameters/common#penalties_coefficient" class="yfm-anchor yfm-clipboard-anchor" aria-hidden="true"></a>penalties_coefficient</h2>
<p>Command-line: <code class="yfm-clipboard-inline-code" role="button" tabindex='0' id="inline-code-id-gmcwf323">--penalties-coefficient</code></p>
<h4 id="description48"><a href="en/references/training-parameters/common#description48" class="yfm-anchor yfm-clipboard-anchor" aria-hidden="true"></a>Description</h4>
<p>A single-value common coefficient to multiply all penalties.</p>
<p>Non-negative values are supported.</p>
<p><strong>Type</strong></p>
<p>float</p>
<p><strong>Default value</strong></p>
<p>1</p>
<p><strong>Supported processing units</strong></p>
<p>CPU</p>
<h2 id="per_object_feature_penalties"><a href="en/references/training-parameters/common#per_object_feature_penalties" class="yfm-anchor yfm-clipboard-anchor" aria-hidden="true"></a>per_object_feature_penalties</h2>
<p>Command-line: <code class="yfm-clipboard-inline-code" role="button" tabindex='0' id="inline-code-id-8tpk7l7f">--per-object-feature-penalties</code></p>
<h4 id="description49"><a href="en/references/training-parameters/common#description49" class="yfm-anchor yfm-clipboard-anchor" aria-hidden="true"></a>Description</h4>
<!-- source: en/_includes/work_src/reusage/per-object-feature-penalties__intro.md -->
<p>Per-object penalties for the first use of the feature for the object. The given value is multiplied by the number of objects that are divided by the current split and use the feature for the first time.</p>
<p>Refer to the <a href="en/concepts/algorithm-score-functions">Per-object and per-feature penalties</a> section for details on applying different score penalties.</p>
<p>Non-negative float values are supported for each penalty.</p>
<!-- endsource: en/_includes/work_src/reusage/per-object-feature-penalties__intro.md -->
<details class="yfm-cut"><summary class="yfm-cut-title">Python package</summary><div class="yfm-cut-content"><!-- source: en/_includes/work_src/reusage-python/penalties_format.md -->
<ul>
<li>
<!-- source: en/_includes/work_src/reusage-cli/cli__first-feature-use-penalties__desc__weight-for-each-feature.md -->
<p>Set the penalty for each feature as a string (the number of features is n).</p>
<p>Format</p>

    <div class="yfm-code-floating-container">
        <pre><code class="hljs">&quot;(&lt;feature-penalty_0&gt;, &lt;feature-penalty_2&gt;, .., &lt;feature-penalty_n-1&gt;)&quot;
</code></pre>

        <div class="yfm-code-floating">
            <button role="button" class="g-button g-button_view_flat g-button_size_m g-button_pin_round-round g-md-viewer-code-button yfm-code-button yfm-wrapping-button" tabindex="-1" type="button" aria-label="Toggle line wrapping" aria-pressed="false" data-tabindex="0">
            <span class="g-button__icon">
            <span class="g-button__icon-inner"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="16" height="16" class="g-icon" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="yfm-code-icon yfm-wrapping-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                    <path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.47 11.28a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06l3-3a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 1.06L4.81 10H9a3.25 3.25 0 0 0 0-6.5H8A.75.75 0 0 1 8 2h1a4.75 4.75 0 1 1 0 9.5H4.81l1.72 1.72a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06 1.06z" clip-rule="evenodd">
                    </path>
                </svg>
            </span>
            </span>
        </button>
            <button role="button" class="g-button g-button_view_flat g-button_size_m g-button_pin_round-round g-md-viewer-code-button  yfm-code-button yfm-clipboard-button" aria-label="Copy">
                <span class="g-button__icon g-clipboard-button__icon">
                <span class="g-button__icon-inner">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="yfm-code-icon yfm-clipboard-icon" data-animation="3337">
                    <path
                        fill="currentColor"
                        d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"
                    />
                    <path
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        fill="transparent"
                        stroke-width="1.5"
                        d="M9.5 13l3 3l5 -5"
                        visibility="hidden"
                    >
                        <animate
                            id="visibileAnimation-3337"
                            attributeName="visibility"
                            from="hidden"
                            to="visible"
                            dur="0.2s"
                            fill="freeze"
                            begin=""
                        />
                        <animate
                            id="hideAnimation-3337"
                            attributeName="visibility"
                            from="visible"
                            to="hidden"
                            dur="1s"
                            begin="visibileAnimation-3337.end+1"
                            fill="freeze"
                        />
                    </path>
                </svg>
                </span>
                </span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
<div class="yfm-note yfm-accent-info" note-type="info"><p class="yfm-note-title">Note</p>
<div class="yfm-note-content"><p>Spaces between values are not allowed.</p>
</div></div><p>Values should be passed as a parenthesized string of comma-separated values. Penalties equal to 0 at the end of the list may be dropped.</p>
<!-- endsource: en/_includes/work_src/reusage-cli/cli__first-feature-use-penalties__desc__weight-for-each-feature.md -->
<p>In this example</p>
<p><code class="yfm-clipboard-inline-code" role="button" tabindex='0' id="inline-code-id-pn8dwxkt">first_feature_use_penalties</code> parameter:</p>

    <div class="yfm-code-floating-container">
        <pre><code class="hljs">first_feature_use_penalties = &quot;(0.1,1,3)&quot;
</code></pre>

        <div class="yfm-code-floating">
            <button role="button" class="g-button g-button_view_flat g-button_size_m g-button_pin_round-round g-md-viewer-code-button yfm-code-button yfm-wrapping-button" tabindex="-1" type="button" aria-label="Toggle line wrapping" aria-pressed="false" data-tabindex="0">
