<div class="yfm-note yfm-accent-info" note-type="info"><p class="yfm-note-title">Note</p>
<div class="yfm-note-content"><p>Spaces between values are not allowed.</p>
</div></div><p>the multiplication weight is set to 0.1, 1 and 3 for the first, second and third features respectively. The multiplication weight for all other features is set to 1.</p>
</li>
<li>
<!-- source: en/_includes/work_src/reusage-cli/cli__ffirst-feature-use-penalties__formats__individually-for-required-features.md -->
<p>Set the penalty individually for each explicitly specified feature as a string (the number of features is n).</p>
<p>Format</p>

    <div class="yfm-code-floating-container">
        <pre><code class="hljs">&quot;&lt;feature index or name&gt;:&lt;penalty&gt;,..,&lt;feature index or name&gt;:&lt;penalty&gt;&quot;
</code></pre>

        <div class="yfm-code-floating">
            <button role="button" class="g-button g-button_view_flat g-button_size_m g-button_pin_round-round g-md-viewer-code-button yfm-code-button yfm-wrapping-button" tabindex="-1" type="button" aria-label="Toggle line wrapping" aria-pressed="false" data-tabindex="0">
